    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“Anywhere you set the anvil down becomes a home.”</em></p><p>When you lead or host a <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, you can shape the space around you into a temporary hearth.</p><ul><li>Each ally who spends one or more Body dice to heal during that rest regains an additional <strong>1d6 Integrity</strong>.</li><li>If the rest occurs in a reclaimed ruin, hex under your faction’s control, or within sight of a banner, sigil, or emblem you forged, the GM may allow the bonus to increase to <strong>2d6</strong> for particularly on-theme scenes.</li></ul><p><em>There are campfires, and there are places people tell stories about years later. You build the second kind.</em></p>",
